* RLC_Transient.asc - Series RLC transient to sinusoidal source (AC input)
* Series chain: V1 -> R1 -> L1 -> C1 -> 0
V1 in 0 SIN(0 1 1000)
R1 in n1 1k
L1 n1 n2 100m
C1 n2 0 100u
* Label node n2 as the output across the capacitor
.tran 0 5
.control
run
* Plot voltage across capacitor (node n2) and inductor current
plot V(n2) I(L1)
.endc
.END
